      "bytes": 516,
      "truncated": false,
      "text": "# agent-kit\n\nA next-generation toolkit for autonomous agents, with personas, skills and prompts.\n\n## Install\n\n```sh\nnpm install agent-kit\n```\n\n## Use\n\n```ts\nimport { run } from 'agent-kit';\nawait run('plan');\n```\n\nSee `PROMPTS.md` and `PERSONAS.md` for the details, and `SKILLS.md` for the skill catalogue.\n\nThis toolkit gives your agents structure: personas describe who they are, skills describe what they can do,\nand prompts describe how they speak. Everything is plain Markdown so it is easy to edit and review.\n"
    },
